repository-code: "https://github.com/DoGood-Studio/legal-deadline-calculator"
url: "https://dogood-studio.github.io/legal-deadline-calculator/"
abstract: >-
  A jurisdiction-agnostic engine that computes legal deadlines and business
  days from rules expressed as data, and explains every result with the
  statute or decision it applied. Python and TypeScript implementations share
  one dataset and one conformance test-suite.
